  <collaboration id="Id_0a3e941d-185e-469b-af70-8bb5e3150f5e" name="SP4. Análise de Risco - AR">
    <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;a name="_dx_frag_StartFragment"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a name="_dx_frag_EndFragment"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Processo de elabora&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da An&amp;aacute;lise de Risco da Contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
    <participant id="Id_6c1f4eb2-2d17-4a64-8376-b1ac112451f3" name="Processo principal" processRef="Id_705b1685-54c6-477b-9fc6-ee9c3d65925b">
      <documentation />
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#FFFFFF" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="isMainParticipant" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
    </participant>
    <participant id="Id_05d7ce2e-205b-4b55-9d8a-1fcbb43ff561" name="Processo de Obras Públicas - FNDE/MEC e Municípios - SP4. Anáise de Risco" processRef="Id_a3683afd-df40-4274-837e-b8007724d6e3">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Lei n&amp;ordm; 14.133/2021 - Art. 6&amp;ordm; Para os fins desta Lei, consideram-se:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;XXVII - matriz de riscos: cl&amp;aacute;usula contratual definidora de riscos e de responsabilidades entre as partes ecaracterizadora do equil&amp;iacute;brio econ&amp;ocirc;mico-financeiro inicial do contrato, em termos de &amp;ocirc;nus financeiro decorrente deeventos supervenientes &amp;agrave; contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, contendo, no m&amp;iacute;nimo, as seguintes informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;a) listagem de poss&amp;iacute;veis eventos supervenientes &amp;agrave; assinatura do contrato que possam causar impacto em seuequil&amp;iacute;brio econ&amp;ocirc;mico-financeiro e previs&amp;atilde;o de eventual necessidade de prola&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de termo aditivo por ocasi&amp;atilde;o de suaocorr&amp;ecirc;ncia;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;b) no caso de obriga&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de resultado, estabelecimento das fra&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do objeto com rela&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &amp;agrave;s quais haver&amp;aacute;liberdade para os contratados inovarem em solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es metodol&amp;oacute;gicas ou tecnol&amp;oacute;gicas, em termos de modifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o dassolu&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es previamente delineadas no anteprojeto ou no projeto b&amp;aacute;sico;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;c) no caso de obriga&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de meio, estabelecimento preciso das fra&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do objeto com rela&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &amp;agrave;s quais n&amp;atilde;ohaver&amp;aacute; liberdade para os contratados inovarem em solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es metodol&amp;oacute;gicas ou tecnol&amp;oacute;gicas, devendo haver obriga&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;ode ader&amp;ecirc;ncia entre a execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e a solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o predefinida no anteprojeto ou no projeto b&amp;aacute;sico, consideradas ascaracter&amp;iacute;sticas do regime de execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o no caso de obras e servi&amp;ccedil;os de engenharia;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:10pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Art. 18. A fase preparat&amp;oacute;ria do processo licitat&amp;oacute;rio &amp;eacute; caracterizada pelo planejamento e deve compatibilizar-se com o plano de contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es anual de que trata o inciso VII do &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;caput &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;do art. 12 desta Lei, sempre que elaborado, e com as leis or&amp;ccedil;ament&amp;aacute;rias, bem como abordar todas as considera&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es t&amp;eacute;cnicas, mercadol&amp;oacute;gicas e de gest&amp;atilde;o que podem interferir na contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, compreendidos:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;X - a an&amp;aacute;lise dos riscos que possam comprometer o sucesso da licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e a boa execu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o contratual.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O que &amp;eacute;? &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;Risco &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;eacute; um evento futuro, identificado e pass&amp;iacute;vel de atribuir uma probabilidade de ocorr&amp;ecirc;ncia e um impacto (caso aconte&amp;ccedil;a). &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;A gestao de riscos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;, por sua vez, consiste em um processo composto por cinco etapas: a) identifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o; b) avalia&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o; c) tratamento; d) implementa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o; e e) monitoramento.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O gerenciamento de riscos, ent&amp;atilde;o, trata-se de importante etapa do Planejamento da Contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o em que cabe &amp;agrave; equipe respons&amp;aacute;vel pela sua realiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Identificar os principais riscos que possam comprometer a efetividade da contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ou que impe&amp;ccedil;am o alcance dos resultados que atendam as necessidades do &amp;oacute;rg&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Avaliar os riscos que foram identificados e mensurar a probabilidade de sua ocorr&amp;ecirc;ncia e o seu poss&amp;iacute;vel impacto;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Conferir tratamento aos riscos por meio da defini&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de a&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es para reduzir a probabilidade de ocorr&amp;ecirc;ncia dos eventos e consequ&amp;ecirc;ncia (&amp;ldquo;a&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es preventivas&amp;rdquo;), ou ent&amp;atilde;o, para os riscos que persistirem, definir as &amp;ldquo;a&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de conting&amp;ecirc;ncia&amp;rdquo; para o caso de os eventos correspondentes aos riscos se concretizarem;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Definir os respons&amp;aacute;veis pelas a&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de tratamento e monitoramento dos riscos, sendo relevante a indica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do setor que, de fato, tenha atribui&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o para tratar de forma eficiente os eventos mapeados.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#F2F2F2" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#A2A2A2" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
    </participant>
  </collaboration>
